WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.310
Change of clothes: check.

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:04.480
Toothbrush: check.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.710
Might need a deck of cards, too.

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:11.010
I wanted to look at this magazine 
with Akari, so I'll take it, too.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.770
That manga I bought a while 
ago was pretty good.

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:15.960
I should lend it to Sophie.

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.370
And I need to return the anime I borrowed.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.690
And then...

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.750
Oh, that was close.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.290
<b>Properly Learn the Basics!
 Collection of Basic Questions
Math 1A</b>

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.290
<b>Comprehensive Japanese
Classic Grammar Workbook</b>

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.290
I almost forgot the important stuff.

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.510
All right, I'm good to go!

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:31.010
<b>Huge pile...</b>

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.830
Or not.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.440
Let's repack all that.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.480
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:09.480
<b>The Last Day of Summer Break</b>

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.230
Oh, right, Hinata said 
she'd come over today.

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:23.560
Maybe I should plug that new 
anime series I like to her.

00:02:25.380 --> 00:02:26.620
Good morning, you tw—

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:27.470
Huh?

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:31.850
What's going on?

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:33.830
Oh, Sophie.

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:34.820
Morning.

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:39.880
<i>Why is Hinata looking so destroyed?</i>

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.910
<i>What could have happened?</i>

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:48.870
Summer break is almost over, 
but none of my homework is done!

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:51.850
That was dumb.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:55.010
That's why we're doing a 
kind of homework study camp.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:57.810
Can we use this room until we're done?

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.540
That's fine with me, but wouldn't it be 
easier to concentrate in your own room?

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:07.230
In your own room, though, it's too easy to 
start reading some manga or magazine.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:08.460
Me, too.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:12.000
I get the urge to play with my dolls, 
and I can't make any progress.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.650
Huh, is that so?

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:20.950
This problem is just an application of
that other one, so it should be easy.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.740
Just looking at a textbook 
makes me so sleepy.

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.440
Focus, focus...

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.500
<i>Hinata doesn't seem to be getting far, 
but Akari's making good progress.</i>

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.090
<i>She'll be done soon.</i>

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.130
Okay, one page down!

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.640
I'm making good headway.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:41.850
I have time to take a thirty-minute 
doll break now, right?

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:45.320
<i>How is being in the living 
room any different?</i>

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:49.570
I'll put these away until you're done.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:53.070
Not Marianne-chan!

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:54.570
I came over to hang out!

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:58.250
Wait, what are you all doing here?

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:02.300
Oh, you're studying.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:06.310
I was hoping Akari could 
give me another manicure...

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:09.380
I've got an idea! I'll help you, too.

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.430
That way, you'll get done faster.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.500
Nice idea!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.310
Having someone else do it 
would be cheating, though.

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.940
Not if no one finds out.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:20.670
Hey!

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:24.120
"Read this book and write down 
your impressions." That's easy.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.610
I'm so bad at stuff like that!

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:34.910
Um... I'm still not totally used 
to writing in Japanese.

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:36.960
Is it okay if I write it in Hungarian?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.230
Hungarian?!

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:41.050
They'll know I didn't do it myself for sure!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.680
Somehow I feel even more tired now.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.170
Hey, why don't we take a little breather?

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:50.090
We could all go to the grocery store 
and buy stuff for dinner.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:51.810
The store will close soon, anyway.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.210
Agreed!

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:56.510
<i>Do they have any intention 
of finishing at all?</i>

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.860
<b>Super
 Market</b>

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:05.170
I usually never go to grocery stores,
so this is refreshing!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.480
Oh, I get you.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:09.040
The stuff at this store is always so fresh!

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.710
Akari, that's not what she meant.

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:13.930
Are these flowers edible, too?

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.960
No, those are just for decoration.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.910
Oh, look at those fish swimming around.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.570
I wonder if they can be kept 
as pets with the goldfish.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:24.810
They look too squirmy and creepy.

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:27.970
Loaches are delicious when you fry them.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.300
Really nutritious, too.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:32.450
<i>So they don't eat goldfish, 
but they eat these!?</i>

00:05:34.490 --> 00:05:37.310
So what were we making again?

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.110
Cream stew.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.340
Oh, I can help with that.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.940
I shouldn't always have you do everything.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.770
Let's see, then.

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:48.660
Milk, cream...

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.710
Wait, where's the roux?

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:54.150
Oh, I just start with a white sauce base.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:57.350
Sorry... I'll have to leave it to you, after all.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:02.040
<b>Half Off</b>

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.530
Look, Akari!

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:02.050
I got some discounted sushi!

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:03.480
Want to split it?

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.290
Sushi with stew?

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.080
East meets west!

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:09.870
If you're making a salad, 
I can help with that.

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:11.050
Thanks!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.480
Oh, this is still raw.

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:17.040
I'll put it in the microwave 
and heat it up for you.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.720
Stop!

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:19.400
Why?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.670
You're going to ruin that nice sushi!

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:25.570
<i>Sometimes, humans and vampires 
simply can't understand each other.</i>

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:24.150
But it's cold! Let me warm it up.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.570
That's the point of sushi!

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.490
I'm stuffed!

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:34.310
Now that my stomach's full, I'm ready
 to finish off that homework!

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:35.200
Yeah!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.900
<i>...is what they said, but...</i>

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:41.590
What does this word mean again?

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:45.990
This just never ends.

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:46.880
I'm so tired.

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:48.840
It'll be okay.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:51.290
There is no sun that won't set.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:54.060
No sun...

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.300
...that won't set?

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.640
<i>Is that the vampire version of...</i>

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:03.960
<i>..."there is no night that doesn't dawn"?</i>

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.480
<b>Thinks she's cheering them up</b>

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:08.220
But Hinata came all the way over here.
We should all do something fun!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.970
I have bigger worries right now.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:15.850
Come on, Akari, just do that stuff later.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.860
I'm sorry, Ellie-chan, but I can't, either.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:21.100
<i>Ellie's getting in their way.</i>

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:24.410
Ellie, why don't we go 
upstairs and read a book?

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.540
Oh, good idea!

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:31.380
It's too bad we can't play 
with Akari and Hinata.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.670
That's how it is sometimes.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:40.100
I'll be extra affectionate tonight
 so you won't be lonely.

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.180
That's not necessary.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.320
Oh, you! So bashful.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:47.680
But you know, I can't belong to you alone.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.440
Oh, my AP finally regenerated.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:50.440
The other girls would be too sad...

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.870
How are you two doing?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.060
Did you finish your homework?

00:07:58.060 --> 00:07:58.960
Huh?

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:02.900
Gotcha, Akari.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:07.870
Sophie-chan, want to try this dress on?

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:12.260
Won't they catch a cold if they sleep here?

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.480
Yeah.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.320
Let's put them into bed.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:22.940
What?

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:23.930
I fell asleep?

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:26.100
I'm in a bed?

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:29.900
I don't remember going to Akari's room.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:32.400
Wait, there's a bed in the living room?

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:39.390
Either Sophie-chan or Ellie-chan 
must've brought a bed in here.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.160
That's so nice of them.

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:44.850
<i>Is that something that regularly 
happens with vampires in the house?</i>

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:58.610
They should be about done by now.

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:04.840
You're still at it?

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.560
A-Almost done!

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.520
<b>Workbook</b>

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:09.530
Yes! I'm done!

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:12.700
That was a long battle.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.770
Oh, so you're done?

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:17.230
I'm here again, ready to play!

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:20.340
What, they're already asleep?

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:22.390
No, they're just exhausted.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.690
I thought we could have some 
of this when we were done,

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.070
so I chilled it in the fridge.

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:29.830
Yeah!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:33.070
Sophie-chan and Ellie-chan 
get blood popsicles.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.540
Oh, that's so nice and summery!

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.480
Let's eat!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.220
And I also have...

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:41.350
Ta-da!

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:45.080
I bought these fireworks a while ago,
so let's set them off later.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.760
Yeah, we should do that!

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:49.020
So we can finally play together!

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.760
We still have a few hours of summer 
break left, so let's enjoy them!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:55.700
Right!

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:59.750
We should make shaved ice 
and get in the kiddie pool, too.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:00.960
That sounds great!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.700
I want to have some nagashi somen, too.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.470
Yeah! We should get ready for that.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:06.640
Slow down. You can't do all that at once.

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:06.920
I'm so excited.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:09.620
Summer vacation really is the best!

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:10.970
Yeah!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.460
I got to sleep in every day.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:17.190
I got to stay up all night and 
talk to Sophie-chan a lot.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:19.140
I'm so happy.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:20.400
Same.

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:26.840
I don't want summer break to be over!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:30.050
Getting up at six every morning is too hard!

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:32.850
A second ago, they were laughing, 
and now they're crying.

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:38.910
Starting tomorrow I won't be 
able to see you during the day!

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:40.570
I sleep during the day, so it's 
not really any different.

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.490
<i>That reminds me, during summer break...</i>

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:47.010
I'm going to take a nap with you.

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.700
It's hard for me to sleep like this...

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:53.500
Oh, right. Starting tomorrow,
 you'll be at school during the day.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.710
<b>Shock</b>

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.990
Why do you sound relieved?!

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.300
I feel so much better after that bath.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.320
Hinata, don't you need to go home?

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:05.230
You have school starting tomorrow.

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:08.780
No problem. I'll stay the night and 
go home early in the morning.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.920
You want to get in the bath next, Sophie?

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:17.140
Vampires don't have a 
metabolism like humans do,

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:19.240
so there's no reason for 
us to bathe every day.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:23.160
Could it be that Sophie doesn't like baths?

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.400
Running water is the problem, right?

00:11:25.690 --> 00:11:28.720
Bathwater isn't running water,
so it's not a problem.

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.950
Showers can be kind of scary, though.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.410
Oh, really?

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:34.330
So why, then?

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:39.570
Back when I was born, we were 
taught that baths weren't good.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:43.840
I know that's changed, but I 
still have this reluctance.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:46.560
Don't worry, it won't kill you.

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.840
I'll put her in.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:50.960
Let's use this chance 
to overcome your fear.

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.380
I hope it'll be okay.

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:57.810
The water is so nice.

00:11:59.270 --> 00:12:02.000
It would've been even better 
if this was a blood bath.

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:05.190
Those are banned. They're too 
much hassle to clean up after.

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:06.700
And the blood is expensive.

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:09.630
Can I come in?

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:15.880
I got this bath powder at the 
general store the other day.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:19.660
I thought you two might like it, 
so feel free to use it if you like.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:26.100
Wow! It's not as good as the 
real thing, but it's not bad!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:29.090
I didn't know they made stuff like this.

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:31.910
<i>I'm so glad they like it.</i>

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:38.300
By the way, how long are you 
going to stay there and stare?

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:40.470
Not that I mind.

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.940
Want some juice?

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:46.820
Sure, thanks.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:51.190
Oh, I've never seen those 
pajamas on you before.

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:52.970
They're so cute!

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.980
Aw, thanks!

00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:57.240
I got them for the summer.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:00.100
Your T-shirt is cute, too.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:03.210
Doesn't this dog look like Mikan?

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.980
Sophie-chan!

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:08.530
I don't see you in black pajamas very often.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:12.680
It's fun to see what everyone wears to bed.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:16.590
The only thing I wear when 
I sleep is Chanel No. 5.

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:18.280
I've been into this lately.

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:20.050
Ellie-chan, you're so bold!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.260
You're going to catch a cold.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:23.020
Or maybe vampires don't catch colds?

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.850
Put some clothes on.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:29.580
Nothing beats lazing around in bed!

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.520
Summer's almost over.

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:33.960
I wanted to go on a trip with you all.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:35.590
We should go sometime.

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.410
Anyone know a good place?

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:39.680
How about Transylvania?

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:42.100
That's where I was born and raised.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:45.170
Please keep it within a high schooler's budget.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.920
If we're talking about places close to 
here, Kamakura or Nikko could work.

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:51.380
That's actually accessible for us.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:54.070
Ooarai sounds good, too.

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:55.520
The sea's there,

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:59.810
<b>Holy</b>

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.790
and the dried sweet potatoes and monkfish 
are supposed to be really good.

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:59.810
<b>Land</b>

00:13:58.790 --> 00:13:59.810
I saw it in an anime.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.950
You can't stand the ocean, though...

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:04.050
And do you even eat monkfish?

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:08.990
I think it's time for us to go to bed.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.850
Sometimes it feels good to 
sleep a little at night.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.200
That's true.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.950
Where should we all sleep?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.760
Everyone should just sleep where they want.

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:19.650
Sure.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:21.910
<i>Next to Akari would be nice.</i>

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:24.650
Where we want?

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:36.590
This is good.

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:38.570
Hey, that's not fair!

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:42.280
I don't get what makes vampires tick.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:43.950
How is that place good?

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:46.300
Maybe it reminds them of a coffin?

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:48.310
Being surrounded by walls?

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:04.260
The sun's setting earlier now.

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:09.430
Okay! I'm going to go to the store to 
have a thorough browse and buy stuff!

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:12.060
Sophie-chan, are you going out?

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.640
Yes. Just going shopping for a bit.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.790
I'm coming, too!

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:25.730
Oh? Sophie, Akari, where are you going?

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:28.190
To Akihabara.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.450
Akihabara?

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:34.320
It was once called Japan's 
largest electric city.

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:37.180
Japan's largest electric city?

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:43.120
Lately, it's become renowned 
worldwide as a mecca for nerds.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.830
Sounds like fun! I'm going, too!

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:48.400
Hu? But...

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:51.620
I know! I'll invite Hinata-chan, too!

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:59.240
<i>I wanted to wander around by myself, but...</i>

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.280
So this is Akihabara?

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.680
It's a lot more ordinary than I imagined.

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:05.820
What were you imagining, exactly?

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:08.330
Look, a store with nothing 
but capsule machines!

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:10.530
There are a lot of manga stores. too.

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:14.480
<i>So it's not just Ellie's first time here.</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.960
<b>New Releases</b>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.960
Oh, they've got the new releases.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:21.150
This one and this one...

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:23.460
Hm, I should get this one, too.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:27.150
Wait, didn't you get the same 
one at the other place?

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:29.770
Yeah, but depending on the store, 
the bonuses are different,

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:30.930
so I collect different ones.

00:16:31.240 --> 00:16:34.380
At the store before, it was a booklet, 
but here you get a clear file case.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.770
So that's it.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:41.160
I thought your memory was just 
getting bad since you're so old.

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.100
That's just rude!

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:46.550
There's even more here 
than at Sophie's house.

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:49.520
I wonder what that restricted area is.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.530
<b>No One Under 18 Allowed</b>

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:53.510
They put the dirty books in a separate area
so underage customers don't see them.

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:57.840
Well, we're adults, so we should be fine.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:02.420
I'm curious to know what 
21st century eros is all about.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.840
Maybe I should take a peek.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:06.540
Let's go, Sophie!

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:10.400
They just walked right in!
I suppose they are older.

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:13.250
Okay, okay... Come back 
when you're all grown up.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.770
I <i>am</i> grown up!

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:15.970
They got kicked out.

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.420
Jeez, how rude was <i>that</i>?

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:23.480
They sure sell a lot of things here.

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:26.970
These look just like Mikan!

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.400
So cute!

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.010
Hey, can we stop in here for a bit?

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:31.150
Sure.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:34.490
An arcade? This could be fun.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.740
<b>Lower</b>

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.200
<b>Sideways</b>

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:52.490
Is this what Mikan looks like?

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:55.130
I was trying to get the one next to this.

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.090
Sophie-chan!

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:02.840
They've got a game of that 
anime you're always watching.

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:06.100
Oh, yeah! <i>Iris</i> is very popular right now.

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:07.760
Why don't you try it?

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:08.810
Uh, yeah...

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.090
What's wrong?

00:18:10.090 --> 00:18:13.350
I do want to try it, but...

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:19.410
Isn't it kind of wrong for a 360-year-old
 to play a game for young girls?

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:21.410
It's fine!

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.540
You look like a young girl!

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:28.730
It's fine. Adults like that game, too.

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:30.010
Really?

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:34.130
Well, if that's the case, 
I can give it a try, too.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:41.610
Wow, so this is an <i>Iris</i> card.

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:44.860
All right, one more turn.

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.090
So this is one of those Nintendo things?

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:48.710
It looks fun.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:50.060
That's something different.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:58.120
When she's like that, she looks 
just like a normal girl.

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:01.060
Yeah, it's not something we see often.

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:05.040
But I also got a little too excited,
 so I'm a bit tired now.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:07.080
Humans are so weak.

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:10.760
Of course we can't keep up 
with vampires at night.

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:12.200
I guess we have no choice.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:17.670
<b>Maid
Café</b>

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:15.920
Shall we go into a café and take a break?

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.380
That sounds good.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:23.810
Welcome home, young miss!

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.990
H-How do you know me?

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:29.780
This is a maid café!

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:31.820
Oh, I've heard about these.

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:34.160
Welcome home, young miss!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.990
Oh, so that's just how they greet people here?

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:38.450
That surprised me.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:41.460
<i>Is Ellie a real noblewoman?</i>

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:44.400
They're so cute!

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:47.100
I don't even know what to eat first.

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:50.630
Now I'll cast a magic spell to 
make it even more delicious.

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:52.860
Young ladies, please help me cast it.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.130
Magic?

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:01.170
Be more tasty, be more tasty!

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.180
Moe, moe...

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.060
Heart!

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:07.770
Do I still have to do it 
if I'm 360 years old?

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.680
<b>Bluntly</b>

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:09.280
You do!

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:11.840
Wait, 360?

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:13.200
Here we go!

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:16.060
Be more tasty, be more tasty!

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:17.750
Moe, moe...

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:19.290
Heart!

00:20:19.290 --> 00:20:20.750
<i>They made me do it.</i>

00:20:22.470 --> 00:20:24.290
This takes me back!

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:28.990
I used to get chocolate milk all 
the time to hide my identity.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.480
To hide it?

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:33.290
You look suspicious if you 
never eat or drink anything.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.880
Oh, so you can drink that.

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.000
I can't really taste it, though.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:43.230
Back then, it was a huge 
problem if anyone found out.

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.300
Yeah.

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:45.650
Excuse me!

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:47.630
Yes, master?

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:48.890
How old are you?

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.810
Forever 17!

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:54.950
I never would've thought we'd 
meet one of our kind here!

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:58.380
So nowadays, even vampires are
moving up in the world.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.450
I don't think that's what she meant...

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.400
<b>Nekotan</b>

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:04.350
Where should we go now?

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:07.360
It's time for high school 
students to go home.

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.660
Oh, you're right.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.280
It's already so late.

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:13.210
Time flies when you're having fun.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:16.760
Yeah... There are still more 
places I wanted to go.

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:19.720
We should come back!

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:23.200
Yeah. We should come here together again.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:24.380
Yeah!

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.220
Let's do that!

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:31.070
Next time, I want to go to a place 
where you can suck a maid's blood.

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:32.700
They don't have those.

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:46.010
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:46.010
<b>Vampire VS Vampire Hunter</b>

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:10.150
What do you think, Sophie-chan?

00:23:10.150 --> 00:23:11.320
Hmm...

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:14.100
It fits fine, but...

00:23:14.800 --> 00:23:17.070
That's so cute! It looks so good on you!

00:23:17.070 --> 00:23:18.870
I'm glad I made it.

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:22.080
But why do I have to wear this?

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.740
We had so much fun the other night!

00:23:24.740 --> 00:23:28.180
This way, we can feel like 
we're in Akihabara even at home.

00:23:28.180 --> 00:23:30.090
Maybe I should make these 
for the others, too.

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:34.100
Wouldn't that eliminate any reason 
for us to go there again?

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:39.160
I didn't think this through!
